    "objects": {
      "value": "Literal cosine grid theta_i, lambda_i; diagonal Lambda; real orthogonal O; A=O Lambda O^T; potential f_A(x)=x^T A x/2 and target pi_A=N(0,A^{-1}); determinant as algebraic precursor of the source normalizer.",
